1785545645250074	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExxRE		item.comment	bn-1mzi	{"body":"Closed DECLINED as a perf bone (bn-2u01 premise check, 2026-07-31). Engine open never decodes payloads (0 decodes across 22 instrumented opens — bn-2ib already banked that win), apply_committed is 0.002-0.36% of open in realistic shapes, and the head/stream paths the algebra would accelerate measure 0.46-3.9%. The open-time story is .pcol eager loading (bn-bka2) and registry-rebuild random preads (bn-26pp experiment). Reopen only if downstream work needs the algebra as correctness groundwork — no recovery-time claim survives measurement."}	blake3:Ofj1meeYHGglwGzBSw_WGl2gA0h5CekZxX2Rt-bOhAw
1785545645273068	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExxhE		item.comment	bn-2dbp	{"body":"Closed DECLINED (bn-2u01). Per-segment effect sections' value claim was skip-payload-decode-at-open; measured opens decode zero payloads already (bn-2ib). The registry-delta slice of this idea — the one part with measured value — continues as the narrow bn-26pp experiment."}	blake3:YR_3R5R0lYO6GuJt-vwugb0IiNDQikfkkZbVtKFMJW4
