1785545654611091	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExyRE		item.comment	bn-18y1	{"body":"Rescoped by bn-2u01: if this bone survives its new blocker (bn-26pp registry-delta experiment), it is a registry-bijection + heads kernel snapshot ONLY — no SegmentEffect algebra (bn-1mzi declined), no per-segment effects (bn-2dbp declined), target metric cold open of a high-stream-count store (measured baseline: 5.13s at 2GiB/50k streams... see bn-2u01 tables). If bn-26pp's O(#segments) sequential registry reads deliver the projected ~2.5s cold at 100GiB/1M streams, DECLINE this too — checkpoints only earn their keep above ~1M streams after the .pcol and registry-delta fixes."}	blake3:OBieDp-IBQBtKSBRIvq3zdaXsGmn3rFuqd4h_99_ZsI
1785545654636124	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExyhE		item.comment	bn-35fy	{"body":"Note from bn-2u01 (Phase 7 premise check): SealPack open_pack reads the whole pack AND eagerly decodes EVENT_TYPE_IDS into a Vec<u32> of length event_count — ~1.5GB resident at 385M events. SealPack is off by default so this is latent, but Phase 8 (default SealPack) makes it load-bearing: audit before defaulting."}	blake3:tbRaZJ4UGWezTsJhSVw8bvHkF10wdPIFS4LoqZGtbqI
