1785614240468634	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExixI		item.comment	bn-5hcg	{"body":"PHASE 9 CLOSED: DECLINE. The control plane is complete in v3. bn-1ojm ran the v4 product-admission gate and declined it (docs/adr/0003-v4-admission.md, trunk ef02c03c): every capability v4 was designed to carry had been individually declined (snapshot install via ADR 0002 pack sidecar, checkpoints via bn-11mk, dedupe via bn-2ctq) and the sole live control, the registry stream, already has crash-safe REG12 ordering in v3. Key correction to the spike headline: the 2 percent scan gate is per-byte and by construction cancels the +40 B/frame framing growth; a v4 store is strictly bigger past 3 appends per stream. Gap density was measured, not hand-waved: 49.8 percent of positions on social-large are registry records, conceded and answered by the frontier cursor contract verified in code. v3 control semantics are frozen as final. The tested v4 prototype stays on trunk, frozen and demoted, keeping the four reopening paths in ADR 0003 section 9 cheap. Seven conditional bones closed without speculative production code. This is the premise-check pattern fourth consecutive kill: one analysis worker, zero construction, permanent record."}	blake3:jHw-7RWgzXH8ploTuRf6hoUaRGXEbNTZHCwxYI9Wbzc
