1785701392434447	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExkxI		item.comment	bn-1qa	{"body":"Adopted as standing practice: every lead-issued worker brief since wave 1 of 2026-08-02 mandates cargo check --workspace --all-targets in the verification section, and all wave-1 workers ran it (bn-11ba, bn-3qh0, bn-1r9c evidence sections confirm). The bn-dbz incident this bone came from (compiled-clean-but-broken under a package-scoped check after a sibling merge) is also mitigated by maw ws sync before merge, which the lead now runs whenever a workspace is behind epoch. Closing as adopted."}	blake3:fbRpUYyDzbRtw-DmHCG3yGehakQfy3IdvZrlS4h8PiQ
